  "problem": "Repeated fit-width raster results performed page cloning, palette recoloring, ColorImage conversion and texture allocation on the UI thread during preview resizing.",
  "changes": [
    "The existing latest-request-wins PDFium worker now prepares shared ColorImage pixels, fusing recoloring and conversion and skipping recoloring for the identity palette.",
    "The UI retains and scales resident GPU textures while divider geometry changes, then queues a sharp exact-current batch after release.",
    "Other resize and zoom geometry changes use a passive 90 ms quiet deadline; unchanged idle frames do not request repaint.",
